      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the detailed comment.\n\nI agree, we can probably remove this tracked boolean.\n\nFor decrementRequestCount, I don\u0027t believe that will work since a particular app/uid can have multiple NRIs tracked. E.g., an app with 2 NRIs tracked, upon release of one of them we would still expect the per UID request count to be greater than 0.\n\nThat said, I think what I have now should work? I removed the tracked boolean as suggested and since at this point the cleanup should be complete, I added a wtf in case the bookkeeping is wrong which should aid in case we run into a similar issue in the future.\n\nPlease feel free to reopen if you see some further improvements here. Thanks!",
